= Teaching Experience

Below is a complete list of all courses on which I have been either an instructor, 
grader, or recitation leader.

= Little Priest Tribal College

Little Priest Tribal College is a small commuity college located on the Winnebago Reservation
in rural northeastern Nebraska. As the college is rather small, I have full responsibility for
nearly all of our math courses.

== Upcoming Courses (Spring 2027)

- *Math Readiness* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *Technical Mathematics* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *College Algebra* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *Calculus I* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *Applied Statistics* (full responsibility, 1 section)

== Current Courses (Fall 2026)

