- *Technical Mathematics* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *College Algebra* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *Precalculus* (full responsibility, 1 section)

= Kishwaukee College

While working towards my PhD at Northern Illinois University, I also worked as an adjunct instructor at
Kishwaukee College, which is a nearby community college. Most of the courses I taught here were paired
with a "support" section that served as a corequisite for students whose placement tests put them just
below the threshold to enter the course. These support sections are an extra credit hour and provide
the students with extra class time to work on the course material. 

== Spring 2026

- *College Algebra* (full responsibility, 1 section)
- *College Algebra Support* (full responsibility, 1 section)

